          on-site, and relocation opportunities. Whether you have a
          position, a collaboration idea, or just want to connect —
          feel free to reach out.
        </p>

        <div class="contact-channels">
          <a href="mailto:mrsohelcse@gmail.com?subject=SWE%20Opportunity%20at%20%5BCompany%5D" class="contact-item contact-email">
            <svg aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M48 64C21.5 64 0 85.5 0 112c0 15.1 7.1 29.3 19.2 38.4L236.8 313.6c11.4 8.5 27 8.5 38.4 0L492.8 150.4c12.1-9.1 19.2-23.3 19.2-38.4c0-26.5-21.5-48-48-48L48 64zM0 176L0 384c0 35.3 28.7 64 64 64l384 0c35.3 0 64-28.7 64-64l0-208L294.4 339.2c-22.8 17.1-54 17.1-76.8 0L0 176z"/></svg>
            mrsohelcse@gmail.com
          </a>
          <div class="contact-socials">
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/mrsohel/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="contact-item contact-social-link" aria-label="LinkedIn">
              <svg aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M416 32H31.9C14.3 32 0 46.5 0 64.3v383.4C0 465.5 14.3 480 31.9 480H416c17.6 0 32-14.5 32-32.3V64.3c0-17.8-14.4-32.3-32-32.3zM135.4 416H69V202.2h66.5V416zm-33.2-243c-21.3 0-38.5-17.3-38.5-38.5S80.9 96 102.2 96c21.2 0 38.5 17.3 38.5 38.5 0 21.3-17.2 38.5-38.5 38.5zm282.1 243h-66.4V312c0-24.8-.5-56.7-34.5-56.7-34.6 0-39.9 27-39.9 54.9V416h-66.4V202.2h63.7v29.2h.9c8.9-16.8 30.6-34.5 62.9-34.5 67.2 0 79.7 44.3 79.7 101.9V416z"/></svg>
            </a>
            <a href="https://github.com/mr-sohel" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="contact-item contact-social-link" aria-label="GitHub">
              <IconGithub width="20" height="20" />
            </a>
            <a href="https://wa.me/8801700000000" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="contact-item contact-social-link" aria-label="WhatsApp">
              <svg aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M380.9 97.1C339 55.1 283.2 32 223.9 32c-122.4 0-222 99.6-222 222 0 39.1 10.2 77.3 29.6 111L0 480l117.7-30.9c32.4 17.7 68.9 27 106.1 27h.1c122.3 0 224.1-99.6 224.1-222 0-59.3-25.2-115-67.1-157zm-157 341.6c-33.2 0-65.7-8.9-94-25.7l-6.7-4-69.8 18.3L72 359.2l-4.4-7c-18.5-29.4-28.2-63.3-28.2-98.2 0-101.7 82.8-184.5 184.6-184.5 49.3 0 95.6 19.2 130.4 54.1 34.8 34.9 56.2 81.2 56.1 130.5 0 101.8-84.9 184.6-186.6 184.6zm101.2-138.2c-5.5-2.8-32.8-16.2-37.9-18-5.1-1.9-8.8-2.8-12.5 2.8-3.7 5.6-14.3 18-17.6 21.8-3.2 3.7-6.5 4.2-12 1.4-32.6-16.3-54-29.1-75.5-66-5.7-9.8 5.7-9.1 16.3-30.3 1.8-3.7.9-6.9-.5-9.7-1.4-2.8-12.5-30.1-17.1-41.2-4.5-10.8-9.1-9.3-12.5-9.5-3.2-.2-6.9-.2-10.6-.2-3.7 0-9.7 1.4-14.8 6.9-5.1 5.6-19.4 19-19.4 46.3 0 27.3 19.9 53.7 22.6 57.4 2.8 3.7 39.1 59.7 94.8 83.8 35.2 15.2 49 16.5 66.6 13.9 10.7-1.6 32.8-13.4 37.4-26.4 4.6-13 4.6-24.1 3.2-26.4-1.3-2.5-5-3.9-10.5-6.6z"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-action reveal">
        <Button href="mailto:mrsohelcse@gmail.com?subject=SWE%20Opportunity%20at%20%5BCompany%5D" variant="primary">Send an Email</Button>
        <Button href="/Md_Sohel_Rana_Resume.pdf" variant="secondary">Download Resume</Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  .contact-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--spacing-huge);
    align-items: start;

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--spacing-xxl);
    }
  }

  .contact-intro {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-ink-secondary);
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-xl);
  }

  .contact-channels {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacing-sm);
  }

  .contact-email {
    width: 100%;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 16px;
    padding: var(--spacing-md);
  }

  .contact-socials {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-sm);
  }

  .contact-social-link {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .contact-item {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-md);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-ink-secondary);
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-md);
    border-radius: var(--rounded-lg);
    touch-action: manipulation;
    transition: color 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;
    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;

    &:hover {
      color: var(--color-primary);
      background: var(--color-primary-soft);
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      font-size: 13px;
    }
  }

  .contact-action {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacing-md);
  }
</style>
